## ⚖️ Trade-offs

### Pros
- ✅ True parallelism (background processing)
- ✅ Best model for each task
- ✅ Single interface (use whatever IDE you want)
- ✅ Unified state (everything in `.brain/`)
- ✅ Extensible (add new models easily)
- ✅ Portable (it's YOUR service, runs anywhere)

### Cons
- ❌ API costs (~$10-30/day with heavy use)
- ❌ Initial build effort (2-3 days)
- ❌ Self-hosted complexity
- ❌ Debugging multi-model outputs

