## 🏁 Recommendation

**This IS the "better than all" architecture.** But the question is timing.

### If You Want Maximum Productivity NOW:
1. Build the Gateway (2-3 days)
2. Configure routing rules
3. Run background agents while you code
4. Get 3x throughput

### If You Want to Ship GentleQuest FIRST:
1. Use existing tools (Antigravity/Windsurf)
2. Manual 3-lane model
3. Build Gateway in Phase B

